<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-MATABELELAND V ENGLAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MATABELELAND V ENGLAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day of the four-day match between England and Matabeleland on Friday:</p>
<p>England first innings 334 (N.Knight 114, J.Crawley 63)  </p>
<p>England second innings 230-5 declared (G.Thorpe 65, M.Atherton 55).</p>
<p>Matabeleland first innings 188 (W.James 62; D.Gough 6-64)</p>
<p>Matabeleland second innings (overnight 5-0)</p>
<p> G.Whittall c Caddick b Gough	 11</p>
<p> M.Dekker lbw Croft		    104</p>
<p> M.Ranchod lbw Gough		     0</p>
<p> H.Streak b Caddick		     67</p>
<p> W.James c Crawley b Croft	     7</p>
<p> M.Abrams lbw Gough			6</p>
<p> J.Rennie not out			 30</p>
<p> D.Vaghmaria c Stewart b Croft	 0</p>
<p> A.Whittall b Gough		     18</p>
<p> H.Olonga b Gough			  4</p>
<p> M.Mbangwa c Crawley b Croft	   8</p>
<p> Extras (lb-3 nb-3)			6</p>
<p> Total				     261</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-18 2-20 3-176 4-185 5-198 6-204 7-204 8-241 9-249</p>
<p>Bowling: Gough 24-6-75-5 (nb1), Caddick 20-7-43-1 (nb1), Tufnell 20-6-62-0 (nb1), Irani 2.2-0-7-0, Thorpe 2.4-1-6-0, Croft 23.5-7-65-4</p>
<p>Result: England won by 115 runs.</p>
</text>
